WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.660
The Gospels tell how, at dawn, women
go to a tomb where Jesus was buried.

2
00:00:05.710 --> 00:00:09.810
They find the stone rolled
back, and the body is not there.

3
00:00:09.860 --> 00:00:13.370
Paul, an early Christian
leader, puts it boldly:

4
00:00:13.420 --> 00:00:17.430
without the resurrection,
Christian faith is in vain.

5
00:00:17.480 --> 00:00:21.990
So why is the whole Christian faith built
on the claim that a dead man left his

6
00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:23.820
tomb alive?

7
00:00:23.870 --> 00:00:27.980
In this mission, you'll compare what the
Gospels say happened at the tomb, and

8
00:00:28.030 --> 00:00:29.200
afterwards.

9
00:00:29.250 --> 00:00:33.240
Then you'll weigh up a big
claim: without the resurrection,

10
00:00:33.290 --> 00:00:36.040
would Christianity have any meaning?

11
00:00:36.090 --> 00:00:40.700
Your mission: find out why Christians
build their whole faith on the claim that

12
00:00:40.750 --> 00:00:42.450
Jesus rose from the dead.
